    {
      "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": true,
        "destructiveHint": false,
        "idempotentHint": true
      },
      "description": "Query Farm Miner Metrics\n\nReturn a real-time aggregate miner classification snapshot and mining-mode and model distributions for a farm.\n\n`classification` counts are independent. A sleeping miner with a fault appears in both `abnormal` and `sleep`. Online miners equal `total - classification.stale`.\n\nUse SearchMiners to retrieve miners behind a count:\n- `healthy`: `status = { nin: [\"stale\"] }`, `anomaly_flags = { nin: [<all types>] }`, `mining_mode = { nin: [\"sleep\"] }`\n- `abnormal`: `status = { nin: [\"stale\"] }`, `anomaly_flags = { in: [\"fan\", \"power\", \"temperature\", \"hashboard\", \"network\", \"firmware\", \"unknown\", \"control_board\", \"pool\", \"low_hashrate\"] }`\n- `sleep`: `status = { nin: [\"stale\"] }`, `mining_mode = { in: [\"sleep\"] }`\n- `stale`: `status = { in: [\"stale\"] }`\n- anomaly subtype: `status = { nin: [\"stale\"] }`, `anomaly_flags = { in: [\"fan\"] }` (replace with the target type)",
      "destructive": false,
      "inputSchemaSource": "mcp",
      "methodName": "queryFarmMinerMetrics",
      "name": "QueryFarmMinerMetrics",
      "outputSchemaSource": "mcp",
      "readOnly": true,
      "typeBase": "QueryFarmMinerMetrics"
    },
    {
      "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": true,
        "destructiveHint": false,
        "idempotentHint": true
